e, while Alexandria is the second-largest city and an important hub of industry and tourism. With over 107 million inhabitants, Egypt is the third-most populous country in Africa and 15th-most populated in the world. Egypt has one of the longest histories of any country, tracing its heritage along the Nile Delta back to the 6th–4th millennia BCE."}}, {"canonical_name": "Italie", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "book_count": 11, "total_mentions": 80, "members": [{"entity_id": "italie", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "Italie", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 25, "variants": ["Italie"], "contexts": ["European country", "country where Chaldeans introduced something"]}, {"entity_id": "italy", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "Italy", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 3, "variants": ["Italy"], "contexts": ["country where misseltoe was sourced", "location of experiment"]}, {"entity_id": "italia", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "Italia", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 1, "variants": ["Italia"], "contexts": ["region where wolves are believed harmful"]}, {"entity_id": "italy", "book_id": "english_physician_1652", "name": "Italy", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 3, "variants": ["Italy"], "contexts": ["country where Garden Rue is used against Plague", "native land of Turnsole"]}, {"entity_id": "italian", "book_id": "principles_of_psychology_james_1890", "name": "Italian", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 1, "variants": ["Italian"], "contexts": ["language and country"]}, {"entity_id": "italy", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "Italy", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 12, "variants": ["Italy"], "contexts": ["country visited", "country with bright nights in 1831"]}, {"entity_id": "italia", "book_id": "historia_medicinal_monardes_1574", "name