us special administrative regions. Beijing is the capital, while Shanghai is the most populous city by urban area and largest financial center. The first humans in China arrived during the Paleolithic era."}}, {"canonical_name": "London", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "book_count": 10, "total_mentions": 84, "members": [{"entity_id": "london", "book_id": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "name": "London", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "count": 20, "variants": ["London"], "contexts": ["city where book was published", "Location of the glossary publication"]}, {"entity_id": "london", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "London", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "count": 2, "variants": ["London"], "contexts": ["city with compass variation", "capital city of England"]}, {"entity_id": "london", "book_id": "english_physician_1652", "name": "London", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "count": 11, "variants": ["London", "LONDON"], "contexts": ["place of publication", "city of printing"]}, {"entity_id": "london", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "LONDON", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "count": 1, "variants": ["LONDON"], "contexts": ["city where the book was published"]}, {"entity_id": "londres", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "Londres", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "count": 19, "variants": ["Londres", "Lond"], "contexts": ["city for financial transactions", "city where documents were presented"]}, {"entity_id": "london", "book_id": "principles_of_psychology_james_1890", "name": "London", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "count": 7, "variants": ["London"], "contexts": ["location of book publication", "location of society"]}, {"entity_id": "london", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "London", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "CITY", "count": 8, "variants": ["London"], "contexts": ["city near Richmond", "city where needl