orbits the Galactic Center at a distance of 24,000 to 28,000 light-years. Its mean distance from Earth is about 1.496×108 kilometres or about 8 light-minutes."}}, {"canonical_name": "Malabar", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "book_count": 6, "total_mentions": 110, "members": [{"entity_id": "malabar", "book_id": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "name": "Malabar", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 103, "variants": ["Malabar", "Malavar", "malabar", "malavar"], "contexts": ["language", "region where Diogo Pereira was knowledgeable"]}, {"entity_id": "malavar", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "Malavar", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 1, "variants": ["Malavar"], "contexts": ["woods where elephants live"]}, {"entity_id": "malacca", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "Malacca", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 2, "variants": ["Malacca"], "contexts": ["peninsula in Southeast Asia", "peninsula with plant distribution"]}, {"entity_id": "gates_du_malabar", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "Gates du Malabar", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 1, "variants": ["Gates du Malabar"], "contexts": ["mountain range in India"]}, {"entity_id": "malabar", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "Malabar", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 1, "variants": ["Malabar"], "contexts": ["coastal region where observations were made"]}, {"entity_id": "malabar", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "Malabar", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 1, "variants": ["Malabar"], "contexts": ["location for monsoon naming"]}, {"entity_id": "malabar", "book_id": "ricettario_fiorentino_1597", "name": "Malabar", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 1, "variants": ["Malabar"], "contexts": ["region where cinnamon grows"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "coloquios_da_orta_15