on_physical_sciences_somerville_1858", "target_name": "Chile", "similarity": 1.0}], "id": 36, "stable_key": "clu_5a20c0ef22ae9577", "ground_truth": {"modern_name": "Chile", "confidence": "high", "type": "place", "description": "A country in South America, known for its geography and inhabitants.", "wikipedia_extract": "Chile, officially the Republic of Chile, is a country in western South America. It is the southernmost country in the world and the closest to Antarctica, extending along a narrow strip of land between the Andes Mountains and the Pacific Ocean. According to the 2024 census, Chile had an enumerated population of 18.5 million. The country covers a territorial area of 756,102 square kilometers (291,933 sq mi), sharing borders with Peru to the north, Bolivia to the northeast, Argentina to the east, and the Drake Passage to the south. It also administers several Pacific islands, including Juan Fernández, Isla Salas y Gómez, Desventuradas, and Easter Island, and claims about 1,250,000 square kilometers (480,000 sq mi) of Antarctica as the Chilean Antarctic Territory. The capital and largest city is Santiago, and the national language is Spanish."}}, {"canonical_name": "Russie", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "book_count": 6, "total_mentions": 42, "members": [{"entity_id": "russie", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "Russie", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 21, "variants": ["Russie", "Russie ' européenne", "Russie européenne"], "contexts": ["country west of the Urals", "country used for territorial comparison"]}, {"entity_id": "russia", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "Russia", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 2, "variants": ["Russia"], "contexts": ["country where Ridley was physician"]}, {"entity_id": "russia", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "Russia", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 5, "variants": ["Russia"], "contexts": ["vast country spanning Eastern Europe and Asia", "territory with Silurian deposits"]}, {"entity_id": "russie_asiatique", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "Russie asiatique", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "REGION", "count": 1, "variants": ["Russie asiatique"], "contexts": ["region"]}, {"entity_id": "russian", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "Russian", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 3, "variants": ["Russian"], "contexts": ["government providing protection", "referring to Russian government"]}, {"entity_id": "russia", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "Russia", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 3, "variants": ["Russia"], "contexts": ["part of Europe with western declination", "country receiving aerial currents"]}, {"entity_id": "russland", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "Russland", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 1, "variants": ["Russland"], "contexts": ["country mentioned in publication title"]}, {"entity_id": "rússia", "book_id": "coloquios_da_orta_1563", "name": "Rússia", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 3, "variants": ["Rússia"], "contexts": ["European country", "where galanga minor is used as condiment"]}, {"entity_id": "russia", "book_id": "connexion_physical_sciences_somerville_1858", "name": "Russia", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "COUNTRY", "count": 3, "variants": ["Russia"], "contexts": ["empire with cold climate", "country where Kasan is located"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "source_name": "Russie", "target_book": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "target_name": "Russia", "similarity": 0.984}, {"source_book": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "source_name": "Russie", "target_book": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "target_name": "Russia", "similarity": 0.984}, {"source_book": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "so